1.0.1 2026-10-23
  - Proposed: repair the EDF data-record layout of all 105 *_eeg.edf files. Each declares one 1 s record holding all samples, so readers report the sample count as the rate (e.g. 84,640 Hz); the BCI2000 .dat beside each file states SamplingRate= 256Hz. code/fix_edf_record_duration.py re-cuts each file into records of gcd(N, 256) samples at 256 Hz; sample values and order are unchanged.
